# Reference KPIs (golden master).
#
# The four pure-end enthalpies are the DATUM pins: on a sensible datum they
# would each sit about 2.4e5 J/mol away, so the datum cannot change quietly.
# lambda_min/max bracket  H_vapour(y*) - h_liquid(x)  along the locus -- the
# quantity CONSTANT MOLAR OVERFLOW assumes does not move.  Their ratio here
# is 1.107, and that spread is the whole reason this case exists.
#
# kind   name      key         expected        reltol
diag    hxy                    H_vapour_pure1_J_per_mol -231233.18018    1e-4
diag    hxy                    H_vapour_pure2_J_per_mol -239303.954931   1e-4
diag    hxy                    P_Pa             101325           1e-4
diag    hxy                    T_bubble_pure1_K 351.452745505    1e-4
diag    hxy                    T_bubble_pure2_K 372.453622433    1e-4
diag    hxy                    h_liquid_pure1_J_per_mol -271912.766061   1e-4
diag    hxy                    h_liquid_pure2_J_per_mol -280791.66824    1e-4
diag    hxy                    lambda_max_J_per_mol 45052.6104262    1e-4
diag    hxy                    lambda_min_J_per_mol 40679.5858814    1e-4
diag    hxy                    n_nodes          82               1e-4
diag    hxy                    n_refused        0                1e-4
